; AlifeAmbience: pin the ambient effect sounds to recordings that exist.
; The effect sections (effect_0..9) fire from the preset `effects` lists: a particle burst, a wind
; blast, and one sound (Environment_misc.cpp create_effect; GamePersistent.cpp WeathersUpdate).
; Vanilla points them at the trx wind_gust set below. Atmospherics' effects.ltx re-points all ten
; at nature\wind_01..10, files that exist in no db archive and no mod, so its effect sounds play
; as silence. This overlay wins over whichever effects.ltx is active and restores the vanilla map.

